            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Parrot learned a few new tricks</h3><ul><li>Share a call's report with your team as a clean PDF, from the Share menu.</li><li>Each call names itself and says what it was about, right at the top.</li><li>An Assistant switch on the call screen, for when you only need the recording.</li><li>One person split into two speakers? Give them the same name and they merge.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.29.0">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
